      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "清除战争迷雾寻找敌方城堡、宝藏和扩建空间",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Clear the fog in search of the enemy castle, treasures, and (very importantly) more space to build!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2707490/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "敌军白天来袭但夜间更密集，必须针对性升级塔",
